###############################################################
# MONTHLY SUMMARY MODULE — API TEST FILE
# Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code to use this file.
# Click "Send Request" above any request to test it.
#
# Base URL : http://localhost:5000
# All routes: /api/monthly-summary
###############################################################

@BASE_URL   = http://localhost:5000
@MONTH      = July
@YEAR       = 2026
@COURSE_ID  = 1


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1.  GET SUMMARY — Single Course
#     Returns: Semesters → Faculties → Amount (per course)
#     courseId is OPTIONAL — omit to get all courses combined
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 Summary for a specific course (by courseId)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary?month={{MONTH}}&year={{YEAR}}&courseId={{COURSE_ID}}

###

### 1.2 Summary for all courses combined (no courseId)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary?month={{MONTH}}&year={{YEAR}}

###

### 1.3 Missing params test (expect 400)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary?month={{MONTH}}


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 2.  GET ALL COURSES SUMMARY
#     Returns: Each active course with its semester-faculty breakdown
#     + grand total across all courses for that month/year
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 All courses — July 2026
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/all?month={{MONTH}}&year={{YEAR}}

###

### 2.2 All courses — December 2024
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/all?month=December&year=2024

###

### 2.3 Missing params (expect 400)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/all


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 3.  DOWNLOAD SUMMARY PDF
#     Returns: Binary PDF file (like the Course Summary Report
#              shown in the screenshot)
#     courseId is REQUIRED for PDF (one report per program)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 Download PDF — M. Tech. (IT) — July 2026
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/download?month={{MONTH}}&year={{YEAR}}&courseId={{COURSE_ID}}

###

### 3.2 Download PDF — December 2024 — Course 2
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/download?month=December&year=2024&courseId=2

###

### 3.3 Missing courseId (expect 400)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/monthly-summary/download?month={{MONTH}}&year={{YEAR}}
